- Generally cool and damp; dress in layers and expect rain.
- Typical year-round temps along the redwood coast: mid-40s°F (7°C) to mid-60s°F (18°C).
- Summer: often foggy; highs can reach low 70s°F (≈20°C).
- Winter: cooler with considerable rain.
- Rainfall (Oct–Apr): about 60–80 inches across the region.

Getting There
- Location: Northernmost coastal California, near the Oregon border; parks span ~60 miles with four visitor centers.
- Drive times: 6–7 hours (325 mi) north of San Francisco; 6 hours (330 mi) south of Portland, OR; 4 hours (170 mi) west of Redding, CA.
