- Guided Tours: Self-Guided Tours – Auto
- Hiking: Backcountry; Front-Country
- Horse Trekking; Horseback Riding
- Living History
- Paddling: Canoeing; Kayaking; Stand Up Paddleboarding
- Junior Ranger Program
- Winter: Skiing; Cross-Country Skiing; Snow Play; Snowshoeing
- Swimming: Freshwater Swimming
- Wildlife Watching: Birdwatching
- Park Film; Museum Exhibits
- Shopping: Bookstore/Park Store; Gift Shop/Souvenirs

