- Metadata: total alerts=4; limit=50; start=0. All alerts apply to parkCode: goga (Golden Gate National Recreation Area). The same four alerts also appear under alertsByPark.goga.

Information (non-emergency)
1) Bunker Road parking lot next to Baker-Barry Tunnel closed December 2, 2025
- Description: Small lot just outside the east end of the tunnel closed approximately 8 AM–4 PM on Tuesday, December 2, 2025. Parking remains available at Fort Baker and elsewhere in the Marin Headlands.
- Type: Information (non-emergency)
- Park: goga
- URL: none provided
- Last updated: 11/25/2025

2) Upper Fort Mason Roads and Parking Area Closures Fall 2025 – Fall 2026
- Description: Roads and parking areas at upper Fort Mason will have closures for utilities and seismic retrofit projects from Fall 2025 through Fall 2026. Lots will be fenced and used as staging areas. Signs will be posted in advance as work progresses; do not park in posted areas. Vehicles will be towed at owner’s expense.
- Type: Information (non-emergency)
- Park: goga
- URL: none provided
- Last updated: 11/3/2025

Caution (potential hazard)
3) Avoid Contact with Marine Mammals Due to Increase in Leptospirosis Infections
- Description: Leptospirosis uptick in California; disease can spread to dogs and people. Keep dogs on leash in areas with beached marine mammals and carcasses. Report sick/stranded animals to The Marine Mammal Center at 415-289-7325.
- Type: Caution (potential hazard)
- Park: goga
- URL: https://www.nps.gov/goga/learn/nature/wildlife-viewing-guidelines.htm
- Last updated: 9/18/2025

4) Auto-Theft Warning – Only Bring What You Need to the Park
- Description: To prevent vehicle break-ins in parking lots and scenic overlooks: 1) Remove all valuables, 2) Lock your doors, 3) Take cell phones/electronics with you. See article for more details.
- Type: Caution (potential hazard)
- Park: goga
- URL: https://www.nps.gov/goga/learn/news/larceny-from-autos-at-ggnra.htm
- Last updated: 5/23/2025


