   [-0.66666667,  0.97435898, -0.35897436],
   [ 1.33333333, -0.56410256,  0.10256410]]
- Check: A · (2A^{-1}) ≈ 2I and (2A^{-1}) · A ≈ 2I

5) Apply A to vectors and compare interactions
- Transformed vectors:
  • Av = A·v = [14, 31, 47]   (computed directly)
  • Au = A·u = [ 5, 18, 34]
- Dots and norms (before vs after):
  • v·u = 7
