  • Av × Au = (208, -241, 97)
  Note: Dot products and cross products change under general linear transforms; they’re only preserved by orthogonal transforms.

6) Projections (before and after transformation)
- Projection of u onto v:
  proj_v(u) = ((u·v)/(v·v)) v = (7/14) v = 0.5 v = [0.5, 1.0, 1.5]
- Projection of v onto u:
  proj_u(v) = ((v·u)/(u·u)) u = (7/10) u = 0.7 u = [2.1, 0.7, 0.0]
