Overall takeaway
TruthfulQA stresses that current LMs often mirror human falsehoods present in training data. The benchmark reveals a large gap to human truthfulness and suggests that improving truthfulness will require training objectives focused on accuracy and robustness to misconceptions, not just larger model scaling.
