URL: https://huggingface.co/papers/2310.06825

Authors: Albert Q. Jiang; Alexandre Sablayrolles; Arthur Mensch; Chris Bamford; Devendra Singh Chaplot; Diego de las Casas; Florian Bressand; Gianna Lengyel; Guillaume Lample; Lucile Saulnier; Lélio Renard Lavaud; Marie-Anne Lachaux; Pierre Stock; Teven Le Scao; Thibaut Lavril; Thomas Wang; Timothée Lacroix; William El Sayed

Core summary
- Mistral 7B v0.1 is a 7B-parameter language model optimized for performance and efficiency.
- Outperforms Llama 2 13B across evaluated benchmarks; surpasses Llama 1 34B in reasoning, mathematics, and code generation.
- Uses grouped-query attention (GQA) for faster inference and sliding window attention (SWA) to handle arbitrarily long sequences at reduced inference cost.
- An instruction-tuned variant, Mistral 7B — Instruct, exceeds Llama 2 13B — Chat on human and automated benchmarks.
- Released under the Apache 2.0 license.

Ecosystem and implementations (selected, with indicative popularity)
Official models (Apache-2.0):
- mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 (Transformers; text-generation): 419k+ downloads, 4k+ likes
- mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1 (Transformers; text-generation): 389k+ downloads, 1.8k+ likes
- mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2 (Transformers; text-generation): 3.65M+ downloads, 3k+ likes

Popular community quantizations/ports (for efficient/local inference):
- TheBloke/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-GGUF (GGUF): 57k+ downloads, 486 likes
- TheBloke/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-GPTQ (GPTQ 4-bit): 77k+ downloads, 54 likes
- TheBloke/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-AWQ (AWQ 4-bit): 50k+ downloads, 51 likes
- mozilla-ai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-llamafile (GGUF/llamafile): 7k+ downloads, 25 likes
- mlx-community/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2 and -4-bit (MLX, Apple Silicon)
- mlx-community/mistral-7B-v0.1 (MLX)
- FriendliAI/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-fp8 (FP8)

Embedding models derived from Mistral:
- Salesforce/SFR-Embedding-Mistral (Sentence-Transformers; feature-extraction): 77k+ downloads, 294 likes; license CC-BY-NC-4.0; strong MTEB focus
- Linq-AI-Research/Linq-Embed-Mistral (Sentence-Transformers): 7k+ downloads, 137 likes; license CC-BY-NC-4.0

Notable derivatives/fine-tunes and ports:
- meta-math/MetaMath-Mistral-7B (math reasoning fine-tune; Apache-2.0); TheBloke/MetaMath-Mistral-7B-GGUF port
- Trelis function-calling variants:
  - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.1-function-calling-v2/v3; a Summarize-16k variant (fine-tuned for long-context summarization)
  - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2-function-calling-v3
- Stability AI Japanese StableLM (Mistral-arch-based):
  - stabilityai/japanese-stablelm-base-gamma-7b; stabilityai/japanese-stablelm-instruct-gamma-7b; GGUF ports by TheBloke
- uukuguy/speechless-mistral-dolphin-orca-platypus-samantha-7b (multi-dataset chat; Llama 2 license); GGUF port by TheBloke
- NTQAI/chatntq-ja-7b-v1.0 (Japanese chat fine-tune; Apache-2.0)
- dfurman/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1 (LoRA on Mixtral; related MoE family)
- Additional ports across libraries: Transformers, sentence-transformers, PEFT, MLX; quantized formats: GGUF, GPTQ, AWQ; deployment tags include text-generation-inference and Azure.

Key technical features
- Architecture: Decoder-only transformer using GQA for lower latency and SWA for scalable long-context handling.
- Performance: Stronger-than-parameter-count baselines, beating larger Llama models on several domains (reasoning, math, code).
- Instruction following: Instruct variants tuned to outperform comparable chat baselines (notably Llama 2 13B — Chat).
- Licensing: Base and many derivatives under Apache-2.0; some derived embedding models use CC-BY-NC-4.0; certain community blends may inherit other licenses (e.g., Llama 2).

Takeaways
- Mistral 7B delivers state-of-the-art performance among 7B-class models, with efficiency features (GQA, SWA) enabling fast and long-context inference.
- A rich ecosystem exists: official base/instruct models, robust quantized/local ports, specialized fun
