- Pets: allowed in the campground, not on trails.
- Water: available throughout the campground.
- Shade: oak trees provide shade at many campsites.
- Pool: typically open mid-April through end of September, weather permitting.
- Showers and dump station: available.
- Website: https://www.visitpinnacles.com/

Reservations
- Windows: Tent and RV sites up to 6 months in advance; Group sites up to 12 months in advance.
