Regulations
- Max 6 people per tent site.
- Max 2 tents per tent site.
- Max 2 cars per camping site.
- Follow seasonal fire restrictions.

Weather
- Pinnacles National Park has a micro-climate; conditions can vary from nearby towns. See park website for the most accurate forecast.

