2) General Sherman Talk (Sequoia)
- What: Learn about giant sequoias, including the General Sherman Tree (world’s largest living tree by volume).
- Duration: 15 minutes
- When: Dec 1–14, 2025 (daily); Time: All day
- Where: Meet at the base of the General Sherman Tree
- Coordinates: 36.581552, -118.751526
- Accessibility: Wheelchair accessible; no seating. From the Sherman Tree Accessible Parking Area, a paved, slightly sloped path (~500 ft / 150 m) leads to the tree, with benches along the way.
- Parking in Summer: Accessible parking at the Sherman Tree Accessible Parking Area and Trailhead. General parking and five additional designated accessible spaces at the Main Sherman Tree Parking Area (0.5 miles / 0.8 km away) with access aisles and curb cuts. From the Main Parking Area, take an accessible shuttle to the Accessible Parking Area and Trailhead.
- Category: Regular Event
- Tags: general sherman talk, general sherman

