- New DLC spikes base-game sales: Risk of Rain 2 and its DLC “Alloyed Collective” both appear in both lists. Cyberpunk 2077 (base) and Phantom Liberty (expansion) also appear together. This is a pattern: expansions lifting both DLC and base-game purchases.
