- Hardware matters: Steam Deck ranks #1 Top Seller in this snapshot, reflecting significant hardware-driven revenue on the Steam storefront.
- 2025-heavy release mix: 10 of the Top 25 are 2025 releases (Steam Deck, ARC Raiders, Battlefield 6, Where Winds Meet, The Outer Worlds 2, NBA 2K26, Mount & Blade II: War Sails, EA SPORTS FC 26, Risk of Rain 2: Alloyed Collective, DOOM: The Dark Ages), showing strong recent-cycle purchasing alongside evergreen hits.

